Similar things have happened to me (v 3.1.3), always in the Gnomish Mines:

Jetlag the Tourist goes down the Gnomish Mines with his +3 Cleaver. Down he 
goes to get the luckstone, passing the Gnomish shopping mall on the way. On 
the way back up, two shops have apparently been deserted (candles/food shop). 
Both shopkeepers are standing beside the outside walls that face the 
fountains, not moving at all. Both were peaceful - they were just not 
interested in trade any more. Naturally, Jetlag took the opportunity to get
some free souvenirs! One shopkeeper would not even respond to being hit with 
a friendly dagger!

Similar things have happened to Barbarians and Magicians. Sometimes the shop
would be deserted with no sign whatsoever of the shopkeeper in the level.
No traps of any type in the shop, not even a pit. Any suggestions why 
shopkeepers keep disappearing?  Trade Holiday? Bankruptcy? Alien abductions?

